# Feature: length task that runs without its person (unmet work). "watch" is a length task of 5 days that asks for Dev. Dev is booked on the higher-priority "build" for 01-05..01-07, so "watch" has Dev only on 01-08 and 01-09 and runs without Dev for 3 days (5.4, unmet).
# Binding: the watch task's span is 5 working days; Dev's bookings inside it are 2 days. TaskJuggler does not warn (allocate_no_assigned needs no booking at all), so the gap is only visible in the schedule.
# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
project unmet "Unmet length" 2026-01-05 - 2026-01-30 {
}

resource dev "Dev"

task kick "Kickoff" {
  milestone
}

task build "Build" {
  depends kick
  priority 1000
  effort 3d
  allocate dev
}

task watch "Watch" {
  depends kick
  length 5d
  allocate dev
}
